Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:37:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1024/3799] soh: rename func_8088F5A0 -> BgHidanSyoku_MoveDown

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the sign-flipped mirror of BgHidanSyoku_MoveUp, running the same 140-frame cosine curve downward.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c    | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c
index 6184310ae..f0c6b9b0a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c
@@ -82,7 +82,8 @@ void BgHidanSyoku_MoveUp(BgHidanSyoku* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_8088F5A0(BgHidanSyoku* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8088F5A0: the sign-flipped mirror of BgHidanSyoku_MoveUp, running the same 140-frame cosine curve downward.
+void BgHidanSyoku_MoveDown(BgHidanSyoku* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->timer != 0) {
         this->timer--;
     }
@@ -103,7 +104,7 @@ void func_8088F62C(BgHidanSyoku* this, PlayState* play) {
         if (this->dyna.actor.world.pos.y < this->dyna.actor.home.pos.y) {
             this->actionFunc = BgHidanSyoku_MoveUp;  // was func_8088F514 [LLM:HIGH]
         } else {
-            this->actionFunc = func_8088F5A0;
+            this->actionFunc = BgHidanSyoku_MoveDown;  // was func_8088F5A0 [LLM:HIGH]
         }
     }
 }
